1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,450
You can send money in seconds.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,250
But buying into a fund?

3
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:06,150
That can still take days.

4
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:09,900
Forms. ID checks. Middlemen. Waiting.

5
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:13,650
Redbelly is built to change that.

6
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:19,900
A public network, built in Australia,
where real-world assets go digital.

7
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:23,650
Bonds. Loans. Funds.
Property. Carbon credits.

8
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:27,400
Ownership becomes digital,
with the rules written right in.

9
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,900
Here's how it works.

10
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,700
One: everyone is verified.

11
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:35,000
Every person proves who they are
with a real passport check.

12
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:37,400
Their personal details stay protected.

13
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,600
Two: the rules are built in.

14
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:42,350
Each asset knows who's allowed
to own it.

15
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:44,900
Rule-breaking trades simply don't happen.

16
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,100
Three: done means done.

17
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,800
Money and ownership swap in one step.

18
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:52,400
Final in seconds. No take-backs.

19
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,500
Developed at the
University of Sydney

20
00:00:54,550 --> 00:00:56,800
and CSIRO, Australia's
science agency.

21
00:00:56,850 --> 00:00:59,900
Its core design is mathematically
proven correct.

22
00:01:00,050 --> 00:01:03,400
Australia's central bank issued
trial digital dollars on Redbelly,

23
00:01:03,450 --> 00:01:07,400
the only public network
that carried them, in Project Acacia.

24
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,450
The result: less paperwork.

25
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,850
Fewer middlemen.

26
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:12,400
Markets that never close.

27
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:17,400
Ownership that moves like money:
fast, safe, and by the rules.

28
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:21,100
Redbelly.
Verified people. Built-in rules.

29
00:01:21,150 --> 00:01:24,800
Final in seconds.
redbelly.network
